# Copy to .env for local dev. In the Claude Code routine, set these as environment variables
# on the routine's cloud environment instead -- never commit real values.

SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL=
HARVESTAPI_KEY=
SERPER_API_KEY=

# Apify, Icypeas, Prospeo, PredictLeads, and lemlist are NOT set here -- all five are official
# hosted MCP connectors, authenticated once via claude.ai Settings > Connectors. Nothing to
# configure per-repo; just make sure each is checked under the routine's Connectors section
# (Evening routine needs: Apify, Icypeas, Prospeo, PredictLeads, lemlist. Morning routine needs:
# whichever delivery connector you use, e.g. Slack or Google Sheets, if those are added as
# connectors instead of a webhook).
#
# HARVESTAPI_KEY (harvestapi.io, Stage 3's first enrichment waterfall tool) and SERPER_API_KEY
# (google.serper.dev, Stage 3's fallback for reaction-URL identity resolution when HarvestAPI's
# own profileId lookup fails or finds no match) are raw API keys, not MCP connectors -- fill in
# real values above (or set them as environment variables on the routine's cloud environment
# instead, same as everything else in this file).
